{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Justin Hilbert","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T16:47:47.414Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Dropshipping for Private Label Supplement Brands | Prexera Private Label","id":"216186378936","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"linkRelCanonicalUrl":"","metaDescription":"Add private label supplements to your dropshipping catalog. Low minimums, no inventory, fast fulfillment. Brand-friendly packaging.","name":"Private Label - Standard Page - Dropshipping for Private Label","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"2026-06-30T16:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"en/pl-demo-dropshipping","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:02:17.568Z","updatedById":"76670497","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/en/pl-demo-dropshipping","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.60), rgba(201,219,226,.60)), url('https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/shutterstock_1346151299.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0px 0px 14px; font-size: 18px;\">DROPSHIPPING FOR PRIVATE LABEL SUPPLEMENTS</h1>\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Sell your own supplements without ever holding inventory.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Choose pre-formulated supplements, brand them as your own, market them under your label. We ship every order directly to your customer.</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.davincilabs.com/private-label-get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Talk to Our Team</a></div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762616,"order":0,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Combine private labeling with supplement dropshipping for maximum convenience and profitability.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Private labeling means selling ready-for-use formulations with your brand and packaging. <a href=\"https://blog.davincilabs.com/private-label/how-to-get-started-with-dropshipping-supplements\" style=\"color: #6ba644; text-decoration: underline;\">Dropshipping</a> means we fulfill every order directly to your customer. Combine the two and you get a low-overhead, high-margin supplement business you can scale quickly.</p>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Skip product development. Skip inventory storage. Skip the warehouse lease. Add new SKUs without buying equipment or hiring staff. Start small, prove the market, scale fast.</p>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762617,"order":1,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">STEP 01</div>\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">THE ADVANTAGE</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">Why dropshipping works for private label supplements.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 760px; margin: 22px auto 0;\">Lower risk, faster turnaround, more time on customer service and marketing.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762688,"order":2,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 6v12m-3-2.82.88.66c1.17.88 3.07.88 4.24 0 1.17-.88 1.17-2.3 0-3.18-.58-.44-1.35-.66-2.12-.66-.73 0-1.46-.22-2.01-.66-1.1-.88-1.1-2.3 0-3.18.95-.78 2.5-.87 3.62-.27M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Lower overhead, less capital tied up</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">No bulk inventory orders. No storage location. No inventory management overhead. You pay for product when your customer pays you, not before.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Faster turnaround on every order</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Our fulfillment is built for speed &mdash; streamlined, scalable, and quick to turn around orders. Customers prioritize delivery speed, and fast turnaround drives repeat sales.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">More time for what grows the business</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">With shipping and fulfillment handled, you focus on customer service, content, paid acquisition, and product strategy. The activities that compound, not the ones that consume.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Freedom to experiment</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Want to test a trendy supplement or a new flavored protein? Add it to your line without a significant upfront investment. Validate demand before committing.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Reduced risk on every SKU</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">You only pay the manufacturer when customers place orders. No more guessing at demand. No more dead inventory tying up cash.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M2.25 18 9 11.25l4.31 4.31a10.96 10.96 0 0 1 6.7-4.27l.31-.05M21 15v-4.5h-4.5\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Scale without operational drag</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Adding 10 new SKUs in a traditional retail model means more storage, more cash tied up, more SKUs to manage. With dropshipping, it means updating your product page.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762689,"order":3,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">STEP 02</div>\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">VENDOR CRITERIA</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">What to look for in a dropshipping supplement partner.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 760px; margin: 22px auto 0;\">Not every manufacturer offers true dropshipping. Use this checklist before you commit.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762690,"order":4,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 28px;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\">&nbsp;</path></svg></div>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Premium ingredient quality</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">The best manufacturers use premium ingredients from trustworthy suppliers and can prove it. Ask for certificates of analysis and ingredient sourcing documentation.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.04L9.34 4.7l-3.94.34a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.36 1.36L3.7 10.34 2.7 12l1.04 2.66.34 3.94c.13.7.65 1.23 1.36 1.36l3.94.34L9.66 21.3 12 22.3l2.66-1.04 3.94-.34a1.69 1.69 0 0 0 1.36-1.36l.34-3.94 1.04-2.66-1.04-2.66-.34-3.94a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.36-1.36l-3.94-.34L12 2.7Z\">&nbsp;</path></svg></div>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Quality assurance throughout production</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Multiple quality tests at multiple stages, not just at the end. Look for FDA-registered facilities and GMP, NSF, or SQF certifications.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\">&nbsp;</path></svg></div>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Flexibility and scaling capacity</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Your manufacturer needs to keep up when your marketing works. Look for proven production scaling and a fulfillment infrastructure that handles volume spikes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 12px; margin: 0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\">&nbsp;</path></svg></div>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Adherence to CGMP regulations</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Current Good Manufacturing Practices are non-negotiable. Compliance protects your brand from FDA action and protects your customers from getting hurt.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762691,"order":5,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHY DAVINCI FOR DROPSHIPPING</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Over 250 private-label supplements. 50 years of manufacturing. Built-in dropshipping infrastructure.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">From ADK to Zinc, we offer <a href=\"https://www.davincilabs.com/product-guide\" style=\"color: #6BA644; text-decoration: underline;\">250+ doctor-formulated private label supplements</a> ready to brand and ship. FDA-registered facility. GMP certified to SQF and NSF GMP 455-2 standards. Our expert team works with you on custom branding, then handles fulfillment for every order so you can focus on growing the business.</p>\n    </div><div><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_StartSellingFast.jpg\" alt=\"Start selling fast with dropshipping\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762692,"order":6,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"padding: 80px 20px; background-color: white;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Dropship across high-demand health categories</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;\">Pick the categories that match your audience. Start with two or three, expand as you grow. No inventory commitment, no warehouse needed.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px;\" class=\"pl-cat-grid\">\n<a href=\"/pl-demo-womens-health\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/womenssupps.png\" alt=\"Women's Health\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\"><p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Women's Health</p></div>\n</div></a><a href=\"/pl-demo-mens-health\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/DV_PL_menshealth.png\" alt=\"Men's Health\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\"><p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Men's Health</p></div>\n</div></a><a href=\"/pl-demo-probiotics\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/probioticsupps.png\" alt=\"Probiotics\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\"><p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Probiotics</p></div>\n</div></a><a href=\"/pl-demo-sleep\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/sleepsupps.png\" alt=\"Sleep\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\"><p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Sleep</p></div>\n</div></a><a href=\"/pl-demo-fitness\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/fitnesssupps.png\" alt=\"Fitness\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\"><p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Fitness</p></div>\n</div></a><a href=\"/pl-demo-weight-management\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/weightsupps.png\" alt=\"Weight Management\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\"><p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Weight Management</p></div>\n</div></a><a href=\"/pl-demo-cognitive\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/DV_PL_cognitive.png\" alt=\"Cognitive\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\"><p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Cognitive</p></div>\n</div></a><a href=\"/pl-demo-pillar\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: #012638; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; padding: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1;\">+</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\"><p style=\"color: white; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">AND MORE</p></div>\n</div></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":1783976820532,"module_id":1155639,"order":7,"styles":{},"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your dropshipping business?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Partner with us for fast, reliable dropshipping. Schedule a consultation and we will walk through your concept, product selection, branding, and the timeline to your first shipped order.</p>\n    <a href=\"https://www.davincilabs.com/private-label-get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Start the Conversation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762694,"order":8,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"form":{"form_id":"d8dfdd90-98f1-4cba-bedf-181dd9286ca1","form_type":"HUBSPOT","message":"Thanks for submitting the form.","redirect_url":"http://www.google.com","response_type":"redirect"},"title":"Fill out the Form to Schedule Your Consultation and get Started"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":1786129286142,"module_id":1155238,"order":9,"styles":{},"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center;\">\n<div><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/PL-Bottle-50-years.png\" width=\"475\" height=\"317\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"PL-Bottle-50-years\" style=\"width: 475px; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(1,38,56,.15); max-width: 100%;\"></div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">NEW TO PRIVATE LABEL</p>\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Get the free Definitive Guide to Private Labeling</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 28px;\">If you are new to private labeling supplements and want to learn more about how to build your brand with our manufacturing team, download our free Definitive Guide. You will get answers to the most frequently asked questions about private labeling, plus tips and step-by-step instructions to make your new product launch easy, successful, and profitable.</p>\n<a href=\"https://info.davincilabs.com/private-label-supplements-guide\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Download the Guide</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762695,"order":10,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">50+ YEARS OF PROVIDING TOP-QUALITY SUPPLEMENTS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement providers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762696,"order":11,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Do you actually offer dropshipping or is this for finished-goods buyers only?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">We support dropshipping arrangements for established programs. Dropshipping means we ship branded individual orders directly to your end customers as you sell them. This avoids the upfront inventory commitment of traditional private label but typically costs more per unit. Talk to us about your specific dropshipping needs.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What are the cost differences between dropshipping and traditional inventory?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Per-unit costs are higher with dropshipping because we don't get the production efficiencies of large batch runs. Setup costs are lower because you don't commit to large inventory orders. The math typically favors traditional inventory once you're shipping 50+ units per month consistently.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>How does branding work on dropshipped supplements?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Same as traditional private label. Your brand on the label, your colors and design. The packaging looks identical to inventory-fulfilled product. Every order ships under your brand and packaging.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What's the typical fulfillment time for dropshipped orders?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Most dropshipped orders ship within 2-3 business days of receipt. We use standard shipping carriers (USPS, UPS, FedEx) and pass the cost through. Faster shipping is available at additional cost for time-sensitive promotions.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I dropship internationally?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Limited. International dropshipping involves customs declarations, varying supplement regulations, and longer shipping times. We can handle some international destinations but recommend domestic dropshipping or traditional inventory + international 3PL for serious international plays.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762697,"order":12,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; padding: 28px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; letter-spacing: .2px;\">\n      These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Information on this site is provided for informational purposes only and is not intended as a substitute for advice from your physician or other health care professional.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207762698,"order":13,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"}]}},"widgets":{}}